# Root + nested packages.
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/.local
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/deploy
**/generated
**/out-tsc
**/.astro
**/.wrangler
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# _archive holds frozen experiments (see _archive/*/README.md) — never build artifacts.
_archive/**/target
_archive/**/gen
/tmp
**/tmp
**/.astro-indexnow-cache.json

# Benchmark output — every iq-bench run writes a timestamped dir here; the datasets are the input worth keeping.
_tools/iq-bench/results

# env / secrets
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.production

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/

# Claude Code per-user local settings — never shared across devs.
/.claude/settings.local.json

# intentic dogfood / demo (local only)
/.intentic
/intent
/desired-state
/app
/.demo
.image-out
